  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mn>7</mn></msup><mo>.</mo><mo>&#160;</mo></math></p><p>The general term in the expansion of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mn>7</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mi>r</mi><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>7</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>r</mi></msup><msup><mfenced><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mfenced><mrow><mn>7</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></msup><mo>.</mo></math></p><p>Then,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>=</mo></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>3</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>7</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><msup><mfenced><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4480</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>7</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4480</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>128</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>7</mn></msup></math></p><p>Now, from the option&nbsp;only at&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>LHS</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>RHS</mi><mo>.</mo></math></p>",
